-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- 4. Univalent Contraction 4: Contractible Spec & Autonomous Co-Opt
-- Every valid implementation in `fiber sem spec` maps to `Sing spec`, which is contractible (`sing-contr`)!
spec-image-contr : {Impl Spec : Type} → (spec : Spec) → isContr (Sing spec)
spec-image-contr spec = sing-contr spec
